[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0010","text":"────────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0020","text":"路加酱，你是不是感冒了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0030","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0040","text":"你刚才\n打喷嚏了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0050","text":"没什么……\n────────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0060","text":"…………\n我去问问工作人员有没有药吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0070","text":"不用了。\n不是感冒。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0080","text":"……这样啊——\n不是感冒呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0090","text":"不过，要是难受的话要告诉我哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600400_02_0100","text":"…………"}]
